{"id":"khren","lemma":"хрен","pos":"noun","rank":1055,"glosses":["prick (penis); used as a general curse and intensifier: crap, hell, nuts","prick, asshole (a term of contempt for a man)","old fart"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/07/Ru-%D1%85%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BD.ogg/Ru-%D1%85%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BD.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"хрена","plural":"хрены"},"examples":[{"text":"Мы где-то хрен знает где.","en":"We're in the middle of nowhere.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"where"},{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"where"}]},{"text":"Том живёт хрен знает где.","en":"Tom lives in the middle of nowhere.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to live","l":"жить"},null,{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"where"}]},{"text":"Она живёт хрен знает где.","en":"She is living in the middle of nowhere.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to live","l":"жить"},null,{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"where"}]},{"text":"Хрен редьки не слаще.","en":"It's six of one and half dozen of the other.","words":[null,null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"sweet","l":"сладкий"}]},{"text":"Почисти и тонко нарежь хрен.","en":"Peel and finely chop the horseradish.","words":[{"g":"to clean, to scour","l":"почистить"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"thinly"},null,null]}]}